                <invention-title lang="de">BIOMETRISCHE AUTHENTIFIZIERUNG FÜR ONLINE-EINKÄUFE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">AUTHENTIFICATION BIOMÉTRIQUE POUR ACHAT EN LIGNE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">BIOMETRIC AUTHENTICATION FOR ONLINE PURCHASING</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method is described. The method comprises: at an electronic device with a display included in a display portion that is connected via hinge to a body portion that includes a touch screen display: displaying, on the display, a first application icon that corresponds to a first application; while displaying the first application icon on the display, detecting a first input corresponding to selection of the first application icon; in response to detecting the first input corresponding to selection of the first application icon on the display, displaying an application user interface for the first application on the touch screen display; while displaying the application user interface for the first application on the touch screen display, detecting a second input directed to the application user interface for the first application on the touch screen display; and in response to detecting the second input directed to the application user interface for the first application on the touch screen display, displaying content corresponding to the first application on the display that was not displayed prior to detecting the second input directed to the application user interface for the first application on touch screen display.</p>
            </abstract>
